Package: folio-sheet
Version: 3.0.0
Section: math
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 24000
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, folio-fonts
Recommends: cups-client, xdg-utils, fonts-dejavu-core, wl-clipboard
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: ribbon spreadsheet
 Folio Sheet is a spreadsheet with a ribbon interface, .xlsx as its native
 format, and an engine of its own: it reads and writes the format directly,
 works out the formulas itself, and draws the grid without a toolkit under
 it. Hundreds of functions, number formats, cell styles, frozen panes, find
 and replace, rows and columns, several sheets to a workbook, and CSV out.
 Everything stays on this computer.
